  "title": "ReposiTrak Traceability Network® the World’s Largest Food Traceability Network Surpasses 8.2 Million Supplier Records Collected",
  "summary": "SALT LAKE CITY — June 16, 2026 — ReposiTrak, Inc. (NYSE: TRAK), the AI-powered, integrated platform for retail supply chain, compliance and traceability, today announced that it has collected more than 8.2 million traceability records from suppliers through the ReposiTrak Traceability Network®. The milestone reflects accelerating adoption of digital traceability across the food supply chain",
